Data Types:
  Integer int ( whole numbers)
  Float float ( decimal numbers)
  Character char(letters)
  String String (words and letters)
  Double double (higher memory size than float)
  Long long (higher memory than int)
  Boolean boolean ( only true or false)
  byte byte



